# Morning Living Worlds (approved series)

**Founder approved:** Aug 23, 2026 · **Docs:** `docs/MORNING-LIVING-WORLDS.md` · **Config:** `config/morning_living_worlds.json`

## What it is

20 **living morning worlds** mixed with legacy morning art (Magritte, Folk, Da Vinci, Einstein, Thursday cards, artistic hero). Same morning job: greeting, who's reading, events, **same caption + first-comment links**.

## Six anchors (every design)

Crystal · jewelry · incense · candle · reader · coffee — all clearly visible.

## Deliverables per concept

| Asset | Size |
|-------|------|
| MP4 loop (feed) | 1080×1350, 5–8s seamless |
| MP4 loop (vertical) | 1080×1920 |
| Static cover | 1080×1350 (email hero, thumbnail) |

Movement: **3–5 elements**, slow — candle, steam, smoke, one reveal, gentle sway. No flash, no everything-moving.

## Remotion (required for MP4 loops)

- **Layered composition** in `remotion/` — not animated flat images
- **Frame-based only** (`useCurrentFrame`) — no CSS keyframes on wall-clock time
- **Live React text** via `EventPanel` — not burned into art
- Reusable components: coffee steam, incense smoke, candle flame, crystal sparkle, hanging jewelry, card flip, door/sign flip, event panel
- **Seamless loop:** final frame returns to starting state
- **Prep layers first:** `docs/LIVING-WORLDS-LAYER-PREP.md` · **GitHub repo:** `docs/LIVING-WORLDS-LAYERS-REPO.md` · rule `living-worlds-layers.mdc`
- PIL `render_preview_loop` is deprecated proof-only; production renders via `npm run render` in `remotion/`
- **30fps · 210 frames** · Motion Laboratory before full templates
- Layer decomposition required — see `docs/LIVING-WORLDS-LAYER-PREP.md`

## Information

Hierarchy: greeting → date → reader → main event → times → CTA → footer (`shopsacredground.com`, `847-749-3922`, logo).

Schedule in **readable panel or caption** — not tiny illegible labels in the art. No prices on graphics.

## Rotation

- Not same id within 7 Chicago days
- Not same **medium** consecutive days (mechanism, compartment, paper, architectural, overhead tabletop, tactile, storytelling)
- No two dark / compartment / overhead tabletop back-to-back
- Busy formats when 2+ events; single-object when 1 reader/event
- Weekday energy hints in config `sample_calendar`

## Autopilot integration

- **Phase 1 (now):** Concepts approved; `status: approved_concept` — **do not pick** until assets exist
- **Phase 2+:** Set `status: active` per concept after still + MP4 uploaded; enters `living_worlds_pool`
- Mix with legacy via `pool_mix_ratio` in config (target 50/50)
- Unused date-keyed flyers in `morning_flyers.json` still win when URL unused
- Never reuse URLs (`image_usage` lifetime)
- Designed-in Chicagoland pride on every NEW plate

## Email

Static cover → email within 1–2 days per `email-from-social.mdc`. Same visual family as social MP4.

## Do not

- Pick `approved_concept` styles in generation
- Replace legacy pool overnight
- Generic mystic AI wellness template
- Dollar amounts on images
